The files keep the video's name (output/my-video/my-video.en.srt) although the folder already names the video: video players only load subtitles automatically when they are named after the video and sit next to it, so the files can be copied there unchanged. The shorter output/my-video/en.srt was rejected for that reason. --clean deletes only <output_dir>/<video name>/, never output/ as a whole, so other videos' subtitles and files written before this change are kept.
